        "@value": "Any driver who is issued an out-of-service order under 49 CFR 392.5 shall report such issuance to a State official designated by the State that issued his/her driver's license within 30 days, unless the driver chooses to request a review of the order, in which case the driver shall report the order to the State official within 30 days of an affirmation of the order by either the Division Administrator or State Director for the geographical area or the Administrator.",
